# R N Multispeciality Hospital (RNMH)

> NABH-accredited multispeciality hospital in Nirman Nagar, Jaipur, Rajasthan, open 24x7, 365 days. Rated 4.9 on Google (1,289 reviews; 3,814 combined with lead specialists). Accepts Ayushman Bharat (PM-JAY), RGHS, MAA Yojana, Chiranjeevi, cashless insurance and all TPAs. ABDM compliant. Located at 109-110, Shiv Shakti Nagar, Kings Road, Nirman Nagar, Jaipur 302019, near Mansarovar Metro. Phone: +91 141 239 0320.

RNMH is a family-run hospital covering nine specialities: General & Laparoscopic Surgery, Obstetrics & Gynaecology, Pain Management & Spine, Orthopaedics, Urology, Neurosurgery, ENT, General Medicine, and Pathology & Diagnostics. Content is available in English and Hindi.

